<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hanjin to take over German shipping firm.</title>
<headline>Hanjin to take over German shipping firm.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hanjin Shipping Co Ltd, a unit of the Hanjin Group, said on Thursday it has signed a memorandum of understanding to become the majority shareholder in German shipping company DSR-Senator Lines as of January 1997.</p>
</text>
